      "text": "alernate -> pick big mnc -> work hard there -> director etc leve. \nsecond alternate -> find problems in tech + other industry -> start working on them\nso no that worthy this option. \n-> for travelling i can so to other country \n-> people also very ambitious in india -> their also indian\n",
