      "seed": 545418189,
      "version": 1249,
      "versionNonce": 1836852611,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768037264023,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- i really liked the problem solving, system designing, mathematics, ai \n- i really liked the time when i was trying to explore other things in startup , going out of job matric and started\n my for entrepreneur page, exploring other industry problem can i solve it and interesting to me.\n- its ok in starting i am doing as side hustle. \n- i really like number, estimations. \n- i really like from learning -> experimenting -> designing -> building -> impact cycle\n- i like learning independtly without example pressure, without degress etc.\n- i really feel ai can change a lots of things around the world and i wanna go in this.\n- i really like to be freedom of time -> like workhard 16h for 1 month, then not work for 1 month\n  than working 8h for each day for two months\n- not sure, but i feel like i can focus one thing at a time with obsession, than doing multiple things. \n- i don't that much like developing things, i like solving problem, let say if i have solution, then my interest might reduce.\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- i really liked the problem solving, system designing, mathematics, ai \n- i really liked the time when i was trying to explore other things in startup , going out of job matric and started\n my for entrepreneur page, exploring other industry problem can i solve it and interesting to me.\n- its ok in starting i am doing as side hustle. \n- i really like number, estimations. \n- i really like from learning -> experimenting -> designing -> building -> impact cycle\n- i like learning independtly without example pressure, without degress etc.\n- i really feel ai can change a lots of things around the world and i wanna go in this.\n- i really like to be freedom of time -> like workhard 16h for 1 month, then not work for 1 month\n  than working 8h for each day for two months\n- not sure, but i feel like i can focus one thing at a time with obsession, than doing multiple things. \n- i don't that much like developing things, i like solving problem, let say if i have solution, then my interest might reduce.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
