      "versionNonce": 1818354893,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768036031724,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "after 5-10 years ( sunil sir )\n- director at some place ( in mnc its hard because of high competition ) \n- cto of some startup\n- staff engineer or principle engineers. \n- might also ceo or founder if want to start new \n- salary would be around 60-1cr (this is after 10 year of hardwork, but its not exponential\n    let say you have some product , we do have 1.2b populatin if you are able to get\n    1000 people and they paying 500 per month -> earning 5lakh -> 70lakh peryear)\n- work hard , kind of give life like in case of escalations, urgency at thing\n   bad happens things come to you\n- both for startup or big mnc\n- but problem is that you might not have worthy equity .",
      "fontSize": 24.258210682657975,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "after 5-10 years ( sunil sir )\n- director at some place ( in mnc its hard because of high competition ) \n- cto of some startup\n- staff engineer or principle engineers. \n- might also ceo or founder if want to start new \n- salary would be around 60-1cr (this is after 10 year of hardwork, but its not exponential\n    let say you have some product , we do have 1.2b populatin if you are able to get\n    1000 people and they paying 500 per month -> earning 5lakh -> 70lakh peryear)\n- work hard , kind of give life like in case of escalations, urgency at thing\n   bad happens things come to you\n- both for startup or big mnc\n- but problem is that you might not have worthy equity .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
