    {
      "id": "xBp91Lvs5j5yns7JFpuO9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1037.9485082560059,
      "y": 11360.628406766475,
      "width": 1913.6025390625,
      "height": 2310,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 828233635,
      "version": 4246,
      "versionNonce": 1944932067,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768042297202,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FAQ\n\n1. Should you continue with job 2026\n    -> yes\n\n2. Do you wanna switch to AI engineer ? \n    -> yes atleast wanna see , basically backend + AI -> and if i got too interest\n       then completely switch to AI\n\n3. Then do you want to join as software engineer or as AI engineer ? \n    -> i can jion as backend also, since i'll have to learn AI it can be any company. \n    -> paralley i can learn , every company using AI can try to find opportunity there\n        if i got veyr high intersted if no opportunity there, quit and find other/\n    \n\n4. Then do you want to join highest paying company ? ( high competition + tough interviews + but top money in country + lld bhi karna hoga\n    basically do the things require for interview. ) \n    -> One thing which i believe, if you are SDE 2 at these company, than staff is very big difference.\n    -> thing is that i am kind of 60-70% of preparation -> it won't be very hard to reach there.\n        and i have good experience of interview these will help to go there. \n    -> why not try 2026 for this -> pick 10 company and try each of them and join them. But making sure\n        your side exploration, don't stop. This thing is similar to iit/iim , people know how touch it is and \n        person was able crack. \n    -> but this time it is different -> first prepare specific instead of waiting for interview. -> then apply\n        like prepare for UBER sde2/sde3 -> once you get confidence then try. \n\n5. Or do you want to join startup ( less pay + esops + wlb + risk ) ? \n    -> If you are trying for big company, then why looking for startup.\n    -> one thing is sure, it is relatively easier joining startup than mnc ( but assume you are joining early\n        if you jioning once it get famous, its also hard in india like mnc for e.g. zepto ) \n    -> like singulr ai, it was easier to crack, so <50 would be easier to crack, until unless they actually wnat\n        the iitian, -> in that case you mnc part will work -> goole -> glean. \n\n6. or do you wanna join some company as AI engineer ? \n    -> after having some confident on skills definately yes. but if get opportunity of backend and possible\n        change to go in ai , will join.\n\n6. what about if get or find opportunity in big company , but not interesting work ? \n    -> will not join , in completely boring for me domain like frontend, etc. \n    -> can join the backend domain\n\n11. What about remote jobs ?  \n    -> its answer is same as startup and mnc, it doesn't matter but i should get time. \n\n7. What about exploring other things like business, startups, other industry etc. \n    -> yes good amount of time , i wanna spend on this over weekends etc. \n\n7. what about other tech things learning then ? \n    -> yes this is tough, i'll have to solutionized this, since both are never ending , and tech/science \n        is my first love. Let's see how can i do this.\n\n8. Do you want to do solopreneur ? \n    -> this is part of exploratin follow up, i'll keep my idea in that notion queue, will start building mvp and try \n       them publically this will help to grow , connect people, and if that really good either sell or grow that.\n\n10. what about startup ? \n    -> this is kind of extention of solopreneur, if i am building mvp, and if i relly like that idea and also people like\n       then all in -> this is like follow up of solopreneur. -> i take it as scaling part of it. \n\n9. Do you want to do content creator as side hustle ?\n    -> yes  \n\n10. If so what content are you going to publish ?\n    -> system design, backend, AI. \n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FAQ\n\n1. Should you continue with job 2026\n    -> yes\n\n2. Do you wanna switch to AI engineer ? \n    -> yes atleast wanna see , basically backend + AI -> and if i got too interest\n       then completely switch to AI\n\n3. Then do you want to join as software engineer or as AI engineer ? \n    -> i can jion as backend also, since i'll have to learn AI it can be any company. \n    -> paralley i can learn , every company using AI can try to find opportunity there\n        if i got veyr high intersted if no opportunity there, quit and find other/\n    \n\n4. Then do you want to join highest paying company ? ( high competition + tough interviews + but top money in country + lld bhi karna hoga\n    basically do the things require for interview. ) \n    -> One thing which i believe, if you are SDE 2 at these company, than staff is very big difference.\n    -> thing is that i am kind of 60-70% of preparation -> it won't be very hard to reach there.\n        and i have good experience of interview these will help to go there. \n    -> why not try 2026 for this -> pick 10 company and try each of them and join them. But making sure\n        your side exploration, don't stop. This thing is similar to iit/iim , people know how touch it is and \n        person was able crack. \n    -> but this time it is different -> first prepare specific instead of waiting for interview. -> then apply\n        like prepare for UBER sde2/sde3 -> once you get confidence then try. \n\n5. Or do you want to join startup ( less pay + esops + wlb + risk ) ? \n    -> If you are trying for big company, then why looking for startup.\n    -> one thing is sure, it is relatively easier joining startup than mnc ( but assume you are joining early\n        if you jioning once it get famous, its also hard in india like mnc for e.g. zepto ) \n    -> like singulr ai, it was easier to crack, so <50 would be easier to crack, until unless they actually wnat\n        the iitian, -> in that case you mnc part will work -> goole -> glean. \n\n6. or do you wanna join some company as AI engineer ? \n    -> after having some confident on skills definately yes. but if get opportunity of backend and possible\n        change to go in ai , will join.\n\n6. what about if get or find opportunity in big company , but not interesting work ? \n    -> will not join , in completely boring for me domain like frontend, etc. \n    -> can join the backend domain\n\n11. What about remote jobs ?  \n    -> its answer is same as startup and mnc, it doesn't matter but i should get time. \n\n7. What about exploring other things like business, startups, other industry etc. \n    -> yes good amount of time , i wanna spend on this over weekends etc. \n\n7. what about other tech things learning then ? \n    -> yes this is tough, i'll have to solutionized this, since both are never ending , and tech/science \n        is my first love. Let's see how can i do this.\n\n8. Do you want to do solopreneur ? \n    -> this is part of exploratin follow up, i'll keep my idea in that notion queue, will start building mvp and try \n       them publically this will help to grow , connect people, and if that really good either sell or grow that.\n\n10. what about startup ? \n    -> this is kind of extention of solopreneur, if i am building mvp, and if i relly like that idea and also people like\n       then all in -> this is like follow up of solopreneur. -> i take it as scaling part of it. \n\n9. Do you want to do content creator as side hustle ?\n    -> yes  \n\n10. If so what content are you going to publish ?\n    -> system design, backend, AI. \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
