      "text": "So on high level, there are few things \nbut yet to check how to do these\n\n- prepare for big tech\n    -> basically prepare more system design.\n    -> do good work at your job thinking about future. \n    -> make one language strong let say golang. \n    -> in between revisit dsa.\n\n- Go into AI -> try to go into AI at job\n    -> so you are working as well as learning ai.\n\n- explore side hustle \n   \n- start working on mvp of your ideas.",
